1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:04,550
Fu Xing: Today is 3rd December. Happy birthday, Helen!

2
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:06,800
Helen: Thank you, Fu Xing!

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,275
Fu Xing: How old are you?

4
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:11,725
Helen: I'm 15. And you?

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,100
Fu Xing: I'm 13.

6
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,500
Helen: When is your birthday?

7
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,175
Fu Xing: On 22nd August.

8
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,700
Helen: So can you come to my birthday party?

9
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,975
Fu Xing: Sure! When is it?

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,875
Helen: At 6 o'clock this evening.

11
00:00:28,225 --> 00:00:29,750
Fu Xing: I'd love to come!

